    "rule_type": "decision_rule",
    "claim_type": "llm_eval_rule",
    "classification_notes": "Phase 36 AI Engineering reviewed knowledge; UI tree and canonical node are inherited from candidate classification. Trading rule bodies must remain in Trading Engineering.",
    "source_type": "official_doc",
    "statement": "RAG、prompt、model、reranker、tool 或 MCP 组件变更在进入 gate/scoring promotion 前，必须在同一隔离 eval set 上执行组件级 ablation，对比 baseline、component-disabled、component-enabled 和 combined 配置差异。",
    "rationale": "本候选已从泛化评估规则收敛为组件级 ablation 规则。它不要求证明某个交易策略有效，只要求外接 LLM gating/scoring 项目在改动 RAG、prompt、model、reranker、tool/MCP 时能说明组件边际贡献。 审计结论：补证后 candidate_id、normalized_claim、statement 和 source_refs 已基本对齐。该条已从泛化 production-like eval 规则改写为 RAG、prompt、model、reranker、tool、MCP 组件变更前的组件级 ablation 规则。PMLR ABLATOR 直接支持 ablation experiments 用于理解方法或组件有效性，COLING 2025 RAG best practices 研究系统分析 RAG 组件和配置对效果的影响，OpenAI model optimization / evals 文档支持在同一 eval workflow 中建立 baseline、运行测试输入并比较配置。因此可升级为 accepted_for_draft。但正式 draft 必须写成 CEK-TA 内部 promotion evidence rule，而不是声称外部标准逐字要求所有 RAG 改动都必须 ablation。",
    "applies_to": {
      "market": "general",
      "asset": "general",
      "timeframe": "general",
      "data_granularity": "general",
      "project_type": "trading_llm_assistant"
    },
    "assumptions": [],
    "not_applicable_when": [
      "只是在建立 production-like eval 父评估环境，应引用 eval.production_like_eval_required。",
      "只是在比较确定性 baseline 与 LLM gate，应引用 eval.deterministic_baseline_required_before_llm_gate。",
      "ablation 涉及具体交易收益解释、K 线信号、fill model 或策略参数，应路由到 Trading Engineering。"
    ],
