    "knowledge_id": "kb_ai_engineering.scoring_rubric.uncertainty_penalty.v1",
    "title": "Scoring rubric 必须在未校准、低置信、来源冲突或证据不足时施加 `uncertainty_penalt",
    "domain": "llm_training",
    "subdomain": "trading_scoring_gating_training",
    "tree_node_id": "kt.llm_training.trading_scoring_gating_training",
    "tree_path": "CEK-TA / AI Engineering",
    "canonical_node_id": "kt.llm_training.trading_scoring_gating_training",
    "canonical_tree_path": "CEK-TA / AI Engineering",
    "rule_type": "checklist",
    "claim_type": "ai_governance_rule",
    "classification_notes": "Phase 36 AI Engineering reviewed knowledge; UI tree and canonical node are inherited from candidate classification. Trading rule bodies must remain in Trading Engineering.",
    "source_type": "official_doc",
    "statement": "Scoring rubric 必须在未校准、低置信、来源冲突或证据不足时施加 `uncertainty_penalty` 或降级；未引用 `calibration_report_id`、`confidence_status` 和 `uncertainty_reason_code` 的高分不得用于 hard allow。",
    "rationale": "本条只沉淀 AI Engineering scoring rubric 字段、引用、审计状态和降级动作；具体交易语义由 Trading Engineering 或项目 owner 提供。 审计结论：补证后可以升级为 accepted_for_draft。rewritten statement 已与 normalized_claim 对齐：scoring rubric 必须在未校准、低置信、来源冲突或证据不足时施加 uncertainty_penalty 或降级；未引用 calibration_report_id、confidence_status 和 uncertainty_reason_code 的高分不得用于 hard allow。scikit-learn probability calibration 直接支持概率/置信度需要校准，NAACL 2024 LLM calibration survey 也支持 LLM confidence estimation / calibration 对降低不可靠输出风险的重要性。正式 draft 应显式互链 CEK-TA calibration family，并继续禁止本条定义具体交易阈值。",
    "applies_to": {
      "market": "general",
      "asset": "general",
      "timeframe": "general",
      "data_granularity": "general",
      "project_type": "trading_llm_assistant"
    },
    "assumptions": [],
